# SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
#
# The production release keys, one per line (base64 Ed25519 public keys).
# Generate one offline with `sentinel-release keygen`, add the public key
# here, and keep the private key offline (the release workflow reads it
# from the SENTINEL_RELEASE_KEY secret). Until a key is added, builds trust
# the development key instead, and the release workflow refuses to publish.
